Subject: [PATCH] feat(js): auto-apply CXSMILES star labels in xpict.render
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Parse ChemAxon |$…$| trailers (parity with Python cx_atom_labels) and
derive star_labels when the option is omitted. Explicit star_labels still
wins. Fixes bare-* depictions for xenosite adducts like GSH.

Closes #20
---
